          "quote": "Additional cracking was observed along grain boundaries decorated with deleterious phases, including the aged substrate of Hf5Ru4 and solutioned substrates of Zr10Ru9 and Hf2Zr7Ru9 (see Supplemental Fig. 4). The morphology of the crack faces are indicative of partial melting of the grain boundary phases, corresponding to liquation cracking.",
